  "id": "osciluna-lounge-stories",
  "title": "Osciluna Lounge Stories",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "The spoken-word diary of the sea cottage. 🌊📖 Welcome to the quiet corners of the cottage. Osciluna Lounge Stories is the narrative heart of the lofi universe — a place for dreamers, students, and late-night thinkers to immerse themselves in the lore of Osci and Ky. Whether you're here to study in the library with Ky, wander the shoreline with Osci, or fall asleep to the soft purr of Tangerine, these original short stories are written to give you a moment of peace in a world that rarely slows down. The full experience lives across three places, the stories are here, the lo-fi music is on Spotify and Apple Music under Osciluna Lounge, and the world comes alive on YouTube and TikTok. Come find your corner of the cottage. Original fiction by Sela Ordaz · EachPage",
